---
layout: blog.njk
title: Blog
description: Notes on Shopify Plus development, app risk, performance and custom theme code.
permalink: /blog/
---
<h1>Blog</h1>
<p class="sub">Notes on Shopify development, app risk and store performance.</p>
<div class="blog-list">
{%- for p in collections.posts | reverse %}
  <a class="blog-card" href="{{ p.url }}">
    <time datetime="{{ p.date | isoDate }}">{{ p.date | readableDate }}</time>
    <h2>{{ p.data.title }}</h2>
    <p>{{ p.data.description }}</p>
  </a>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
